translations.description:
If Learning Path has no translations, i.e. its `default_language` is `null`,
then array with one element is returned:
```json
[
  {
    "code": null,
    "title": "A title"
  }
]
```

If Learning Path has translations, then array with multiple elements is returned
and the first element contains translations for the default language:
```json
[
  {
    "code": "en",
    "title": "english title"
  },
  {
    "code": "pl",
    "title": "polski tytuł"
  }
]
```

